<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>How can a dead dog like me</l><l>Be prepared unto glory?</l><l>Oh, I’m a vessel of mercy!</l><l>I can’t despise the riches</l><l>Of His kindness.</l><l>He’s leading me to repentance!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
